0 44 409 [
[(You can use this to make an abstraction send values to a specific [receive])]
[(in the parent patch. Alternatively, you can make internal local connections)]
[(as shown below with "$1-c", whereas the middle boxes get crosstalk between)]
[(the windows. "$0" is a counter, where every patch gets its own value \050a)]
[(unique ID number\051. Therefore, boxes at right with "$0" also get unique)]
[(names.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
